{"version":"2026.10.11-r25","id":"Q2984452","formula":"C₁₀Mn₂O₁₀","hill":"C10Mn2O10","elements":["C","O","Mn"],"composition":{"C":10.0,"O":10.0,"Mn":2.0},"names":{"en":"Dimanganese decacarbonyl","ru":"Декакарбонилдимарганец"},"descriptions":{"en":"Dimanganese decacarbonyl, which has the chemical formula Mn2(CO)10, is a binary bimetallic carbonyl complex centered around the first row transition metal manganese. The first reported synthesis of Mn2(CO)10 was in 1954 at Linde Air Products Company and was performed by Brimm, Lynch, and Sesny. Their hypothesis about, and synthesis of, dimanganese decacarbonyl was fundamentally guided by the previously known dirhenium decacarbonyl (Re2(CO)10), the heavy atom analogue of Mn2(CO)10.","ru":"Декакарбонилдимарганец — карбонильный комплекс марганца состава Mn2(CO)10. Представляет собой диамагнитные жёлтые кристаллы, не растворимые в воде, но растворимые в органических растворителях. Находит применение при получении порошкообразного марганца и нанесении марганцевых покрытий."},"fame":16,"pubchemCid":517769,"mass":389.98,"charge":0,"smiles":"[C-]#[O+].[C-]#[O+].[C-]#[O+].[C-]#[O+].[C-]#[O+].[C-]#[O+].[C-]#[O+].[C-]#[O+].[C-]#[O+].[C-]#[O+].[Mn].[Mn]","inchikey":"QFEOTYVTTQCYAZ-UHFFFAOYSA-N","iupac":"carbon monoxide;manganese","classes":[{"qid":"Q113145171","names":{"en":"type of chemical entity","ru":"тип химического объекта","uk":"тип хімічної сутності"}}],"structureInfo":{"kind":"crystal","source":"materialsproject","ref":"mp-836079","atoms":92,"license":"CC BY 4.0, Materials Project"},"structure":{"cell":[[18.049,0.0,0.0],[0.0,7.335,0.0],[-8.623,0.0,11.737]],"kind":"crystal","atoms":[{"x":1.06,"y":5.369,"z":9.136,"el":"Mn"},{"x":4.053,"y":5.369,"z":8.47,"el":"Mn"},{"x":8.365,"y":1.966,"z":2.601,"el":"Mn"},{"x":5.372,"y":1.966,"z":3.267,"el":"Mn"},{"x":8.3,"y":1.746,"z":9.473,"el":"C"},{"x":5.838,"y":5.414,"z":8.132,"el":"C"},{"x":1.125,"y":5.589,"z":2.264,"el":"C"},{"x":3.587,"y":1.921,"z":3.605,"el":"C"},{"x":1.578,"y":6.106,"